  <data name="BanDescriptionAndObservations" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>&lt;p&gt;
             Banning this user here will also ban all of his accounts from games. If you want to ban any game account
             specific go to the game accounts area.
         &lt;/p&gt;

         &lt;p&gt;Remarks: &lt;/p&gt;
         &lt;ul&gt;
             &lt;li&gt;
                 Cancellation: If the ban requires user activity to get your account back, then it may be
                 called off. This does NOT clear the user's file, the next ban for the same reason will result in a more severe punishment.
             &lt;/li&gt;
             &lt;li&gt;
                 Pardon: Pardon is given when the ban has been unfairly granted, however, it will remain on the user's list but
                 will not count on the list of relapses.
             &lt;/li&gt;
             &lt;li&gt;Permanent Bans cannot be canceled, but some can be forgiven.&lt;/li&gt;
